### A4 Buchung/Serienbuchung, A5 ändern/stornieren, A6 Buchungen einsehen
# Voraussetzung: ./mvnw spring-boot:run (Umgebung "dev" = Dev-Seed, "testdata" = nach scripts/generate-data.sql)
# Zeiten mit Offset; in der URL wird "+" als %2B geschrieben.

### Eigener Raum, damit die Aufrufe wiederholbar sind
POST {{host}}/api/locations
X-User-Id: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "parentId": null, "name": "Buchungs-Beispiele {{$random.uuid}}", "type": "FLOOR" }

> {% client.global.set("floorId", response.body.id); %}

###
POST {{host}}/api/rooms
X-User-Id: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "locationId": {{floorId}}, "name": "Projektraum", "capacity": 6 }

> {% client.global.set("roomId", response.body.id); %}

### A4 Einzelbuchung (alice) → 201
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
X-User-Id: {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": {{roomId}}, "startTime": "2026-11-02T09:00:00+01:00", "endTime": "2026-11-02T10:00:00+01:00", "title": "Sprint Review" }

> {% client.global.set("bookingId", response.body[0].id); %}

### A4 Überschneidung (bob) → 409 (Exclusion-Constraint)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
X-User-Id: {{bob}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": {{roomId}}, "startTime": "2026-11-02T09:30:00+01:00", "endTime": "2026-11-02T10:30:00+01:00", "title": "Kollision" }

### A4 Direkt anschliessende Buchung ist erlaubt → 201
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
X-User-Id: {{bob}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": {{roomId}}, "startTime": "2026-11-02T10:00:00+01:00", "endTime": "2026-11-02T11:00:00+01:00", "title": "Anschluss" }

### A4 Serie: 4 Wochen, jeden Dienstag → 201 mit 4 Terminen
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
X-User-Id: {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": {{roomId}}, "startTime": "2026-11-03T14:00:00+01:00", "endTime": "2026-11-03T15:00:00+01:00", "title": "Weekly", "occurrences": 4 }

### T4 Serie, deren 3. Termin mit der Serie oben kollidiert → 409, kein Termin bleibt bestehen
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
X-User-Id: {{bob}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": {{roomId}}, "startTime": "2026-11-03T14:30:00+01:00", "endTime": "2026-11-03T15:30:00+01:00", "title": "Rollback", "occurrences": 3 }

### Nachweis Rollback: bob hat im Raum nur die Anschlussbuchung
GET {{host}}/api/bookings?roomId={{roomId}}&userId={{bob}}

### A5 Buchung lesen (version merken)
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}

> {% client.global.set("version", response.body.version); %}

### A5 Fremde Buchung ändern (bob) → 403
PUT {{host}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
X-User-Id: {{bob}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-11-02T08:00:00+01:00", "endTime": "2026-11-02T09:00:00+01:00", "title": "Übernommen", "version": {{version}} }

### A5 Verschieben (alice, gelesene version) → 200, version erhöht
PUT {{host}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
X-User-Id: {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-11-02T08:00:00+01:00", "endTime": "2026-11-02T09:00:00+01:00", "title": "Sprint Review", "version": {{version}} }

### A5 Nochmals mit veralteter version → 409 (verlorenes Update erkannt)
PUT {{host}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
X-User-Id: {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startTime": "2026-11-02T07:00:00+01:00", "endTime": "2026-11-02T08:00:00+01:00", "title": "Sprint Review", "version": {{version}} }

### A5 Stornieren (Admin) → 204, Status CANCELLED
DELETE {{host}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
X-User-Id: {{admin}}

### A6 Liste: Raum und Zeitraum, erste Seite à 2 (Sortierung start_time, id)
GET {{host}}/api/bookings?roomId={{roomId}}&from=2026-11-01T00:00:00%2B01:00&to=2026-12-01T00:00:00%2B01:00&size=2&page=0

### A6 Liste: zweite Seite
GET {{host}}/api/bookings?roomId={{roomId}}&from=2026-11-01T00:00:00%2B01:00&to=2026-12-01T00:00:00%2B01:00&size=2&page=1

### A6 Liste: Standort inkl. Unterebenen, nur aktive Buchungen von alice
GET {{host}}/api/bookings?locationId={{floorId}}&userId={{alice}}&status=ACTIVE

### A6 Seitengrösse über 100 → 400
GET {{host}}/api/bookings?size=101
